{
	"character": "Chloe",
	"voice": "af_sky",
	"speed": 1,
	"lines": {
		"Hi! Sorry. Hi. You're Elena! I'm Chloe: socials, the newsletter, and one very haunted unfinished novel. Do you like horror films?": "chloe-5babc9259d.mp3",
		"Vespera Thorne. The Hollow Bride? Velvet everywhere, nobody blinks for ninety minutes. It changed my life.": "chloe-92475f3bd9.mp3",
		"No relation to Arthur, before you ask. I asked. He did not enjoy it.": "chloe-c830ff913e.mp3",
		"Her films don't scare you while you watch them. They scare you three days later, in the shower.": "chloe-85f1e49327.mp3",
		"Okay okay okay. There's a midnight screening in Burlington next month and I am dragging you to it.": "chloe-1ddfb2923a.mp3",
		"You've seen it? Nobody has seen it! I'm going to cry a little.": "chloe-a1ffd84c6a.mp3",
		"I know. It's a lot. I'll stop.": "chloe-4337dc92ce.mp3",
		"So where were you before? Somewhere with real seasons?": "chloe-984a02bfe1.mp3",
		"Can I say something? Your hair is incredible. Like a fairy-tale witch. The good kind of witch!": "chloe-a893d07a80.mp3",
		"Why Blackwood, though? Nobody moves here on purpose. Except me, and I'm a cautionary tale.": "chloe-38be2bd00d.mp3",
		"Do you write too? You have writer hands. That's not a thing. I just made it a thing.": "chloe-821a330c91.mp3",
		"Wait. Washington? Like, rain-and-pine-trees-and-vampires Washington? Tell me everything.": "chloe-b458675530.mp3",
		"Sorry. I ask too many questions. Miles says it's my whole personality.": "chloe-fcc4ac185e.mp3",
		"Can I show you something weird? I keep drawing this. Velvet, like a room with no walls. Ribbons. And a man. I don't know who he is.": "chloe-b229d5388c.mp3",
		"I drew this last night. I don't remember drawing it. I woke up and it was just there. Does it mean anything to you?": "chloe-6e5f673219.mp3",
		"He's holding his hand out in every one. Like he's waiting for someone to take it.": "chloe-57bc3e7faa.mp3",
		"Sorry. That's creepy. I'll put it away.": "chloe-c76002be2f.mp3",
		"You went really pale just now. Do you know him?": "chloe-b96c42f124.mp3",
		"It's going in the novel. Obviously. Everything goes in the novel.": "chloe-112a5ce99c.mp3",
		"Right. Yeah. Too many horror films. Occupational hazard.": "chloe-bd0a75543d.mp3",
		"Thanks. Seriously. Everyone else just says I'm being dramatic.": "chloe-7718b55be7.mp3",
		"Okay. I'll stop drawing him before bed. Probably.": "chloe-ef9283df36.mp3",
		"Okay. If you say so. I'll try to believe you.": "chloe-56077d4ae8.mp3",
		"Okay! Lunch tomorrow? I know the only good sandwich in Vermont.": "chloe-78cb366178.mp3",
		"Bye, Elena! Don't let Arthur scare you. He's mostly bark and red ink.": "chloe-97229cee18.mp3",
		"I should post something before the algorithm forgets we exist. Come back soon?": "chloe-b0a58a9a42.mp3",
		"Tomorrow. Lunch. I'm putting it in my phone so you can't escape.": "chloe-300fb2f0fe.mp3",
		"Lock your door tonight. That's... I don't know why I said that. Bye!": "chloe-41acbd4899.mp3"
	}
